"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"BYRONofCALGARY","author_id":"217610623","text":"@ThailandMedicaX I recall when Ebola responders were Time Mag's Person of the Year \n...avg'g a 50% death rate as H1 does\n...Covid in USA ran only 2%","in_corpus":false,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":28.235,"parent_id":"1882252490013626603","conversation_id":"1882246569472471047"},{"id":"1882378713075237326","x":0.215636,"y":24.0,"t":1737629032,"iso":"2025-01-23T10:43:52.000Z","rt":4,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":10,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"PinsolleT","author_id":"1217094231031980034","text":"@ThailandMedicaX Du coup, on comprend mieux ceci ⬇️ 😬 https://t.co/lq5cIjCDdz","in_corpus":false,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":4,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":8.574,"parent_id":"1882252490013626603","conversation_id":"1882246569472471047"},{"id":"1882345352059380061","x":0.160066,"y":23.0,"t":1737621078,"iso":"2025-01-23T08:31:18.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":2,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"DebK_hEDS","author_id":"54941160","text":"@ThailandMedicaX Been dealing with autoimmune encephalitis in my child for a year, HCWs here are unable to dx this accurately and unable to figure out how to treat. If more is coming I can’t imagine the outcome","in_corpus":false,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":6.364,"parent_id":"1882252490013626603","conversation_id":"1882246569472471047"},{"id":"1882304931006415332","x":0.092738,"y":22.0,"t":1737611441,"iso":"2025-01-23T05:50:41.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"txlively1","author_id":"1206551683","text":"@ThailandMedicaX Please keep us updated..","in_corpus":false,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":3.687,"parent_id":"1882252490013626603","conversation_id":"1882246569472471047"},{"id":"1882259521504190614","x":0.017103,"y":19.75,"t":1737600615,"iso":"2025-01-23T02:50:15.000Z","rt":2,"replies":3,"quotes":0,"likes":4,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"freeswood81","author_id":"1865054364429123584","text":"@ThailandMedicaX This explains why he shut down the spread of information by the cdc and the nih.","in_corpus":false,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":3,"subtree_size":10,"dt_root_h":0.68,"parent_id":"1882252490013626603","conversation_id":"1882246569472471047"},{"id":"1882341910775582945","x":0.154337,"y":21.0,"t":1737620258,"iso":"2025-01-23T08:17:38.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":4,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"SuchaMess2020","author_id":"90514358","text":"@freeswood81 @ThailandMedicaX 2/2 Even if it's a less lethal variant of H5N1: a death rate of 20% would kill how many millions globally before Govs do something? most ppl's immune system is seriously damaged after too many C19 reinfections. It's time to burst the bubble of Delusion before it's too late.","in_corpus":false,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":2,"dt_root_h":6.136,"parent_id":"1882259521504190614","conversation_id":"1882246569472471047"},{"id":"1882357162158288914","x":0.179739,"y":21.0,"t":1737623894,"iso":"2025-01-23T09:18:14.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":4,"author":"scoobysnack0","author_id":"2877124933","text":"@SuchaMess2020 @freeswood81 @ThailandMedicaX A mortality rate if 10% would be civilization-ending as we know it. Let alone 20%.","in_corpus":false,"depth":4,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":7.146,"parent_id":"1882341910775582945","conversation_id":"1882246569472471047"},{"id":"1882340169296306197","x":0.151437,"y":20.0,"t":1737619843,"iso":"2025-01-23T08:10:43.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":2,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"SuchaMess2020","author_id":"90514358","text":"@freeswood81 @ThailandMedicaX Most countries will ignore it, expect massive disinfo to downplay deaths +focus attention on distractions (Superbowl,Oscars in US), knowing most ppl won't comply to safety protocols so it'll be a total Let it RIP that will crush Public Health in many countries, many will die.","in_corpus":false,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":2,"dt_root_h":6.021,"parent_id":"1882259521504190614","conversation_id":"1882246569472471047"},{"id":"1882343971013435594","x":0.157767,"y":20.0,"t":1737620749,"iso":"2025-01-23T08:25:49.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":4,"author":"SuchaMess2020","author_id":"90514358","text":"@freeswood81 @ThailandMedicaX I can not stress enough how alarming this is esp in the US, for the sake of the Economy the Public Health safety playbook we saw in 2020 will be ignored. Trump didn't order a shut down of public info from Health Dept/Orgs by coincidence on his 1st week in Office. They know.","in_corpus":false,"depth":4,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":6.273,"parent_id":"1882340169296306197","conversation_id":"1882246569472471047"},{"id":"1882260359270301700","x":0.0185,"y":18.5,"t":1737600815,"iso":"2025-01-23T02:53:35.000Z","rt":1,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":5,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"ThailandMedicaX","author_id":"1684401112449957889","text":"@freeswood81 A lot of governments are already aware of what is brewing in China!","in_corpus":false,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":1,"subtree_size":5,"dt_root_h":0.736,"parent_id":"1882259521504190614","conversation_id":"1882246569472471047"},{"id":"1882260568436039915","x":0.018842,"y":18.5,"t":1737600864,"iso":"2025-01-23T02:54:24.000Z","rt":0,"replies":2,"quotes":0,"likes":1,"relation":"reply","niveau":4,"author":"freeswood81","author_id":"1865054364429123584","text":"@ThailandMedicaX How long do we have till we have a wider spread? Ball park guess","in_corpus":false,"depth":4,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":4,"dt_root_h":0.749,"parent_id":"1882260359270301700","conversation_id":"1882246569472471047"},{"id":"1882480793018380457","x":0.385671,"y":19.0,"t":1737653370,"iso":"2025-01-23T17:29:30.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relatio